        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: J. P. Doherty, Debbie Harry, Cyndi Lauper\n- Tours: True Colors tour, Necessary Evil tour\n- Music: Necessary Evil, Blondie\n\nFacts:\n- Debbie Harry was born as Angela Tremble on July 1, 1945.\n- Debbie Harry is an American singer-songwriter and actress best known as the lead singer of the new wave band Blondie.\n- In June 2007, J. P. Doherty toured with Debbie Harry on Cyndi Lauper's True Colors tour.\n- In November and December 2007, J. P. Doherty toured with Debbie Harry on the Necessary Evil tour in support of Harry's 2007 release \"Necessary Evil\".",
